1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
I'm your China Travel Expert.
我是你的中国旅游专家

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:04,000
The floating mountains from Avatar are real.
阿凡达的悬浮山·是真的

3
00:00:04,000 --> 00:00:06,300
Thousands of stone pillars, wrapped in mist.
千百根石柱·云雾缠绕

4
00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600
Water carved them over 380 million years.
流水雕琢·3.8亿年

5
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:11,000
This is Zhangjiajie, in Hunan.
这是湖南张家界

6
00:00:11,000 --> 00:00:13,400
One pillar towers 1,080 meters high.
一根石柱·高1080米

7
00:00:13,400 --> 00:00:15,700
