旧名·南天一柱

8
00:00:15,700 --> 00:00:18,100
After the movie, it was renamed "Avatar Mountain."
电影之后·改叫阿凡达山

9
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:20,500
UNESCO listed it back in 1992.
早在1992年·入选世界遗产

10
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:23,200
★ Expert Tip: Come after rain — the mist between the pillars is unreal.
内行提示：雨后再来·柱间云海最绝

11
